WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:08.000
<v Narrator><i>The wind dies as the ship approaches the Sirens' island.</i>

2
00:00:08.050 --> 00:00:15.850
<v Narrator><i>Odysseus softens wax and seals every crewman's ears.</i>

3
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:25.460
<v Narrator><i>The men bind him upright to the mast and row past the flowered shore.</i>

4
00:00:25.510 --> 00:00:31.470
<v Narrator><i>The Sirens promise total knowledge.</i>

5
00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:37.280
<v Narrator><i>Odysseus struggles and signals to be released.</i>

6
00:00:37.330 --> 00:00:47.130
<v Narrator><i>Perimedes and Eurylochus tighten the ropes until the song fades.</i>
